{"seconds": 40.3, "exit": 0, "final": "Perfect! Kb3 is forced. So the line is clear:\n\n**Main line:** Rxa2+ Kb3 R2a3+ Kxb4 R8a4+ Kc5 Rxd4\n\nThis wins material (a knight) for Black. The motif is a **fork** - after R8a4+, Black's rooks attack the king and knight, forcing the king to move and allowing Rxd4.\n\nHere's my coaching note and answer:\n\n---\n\n**Best move:** Rxa2+\n\n**Coaching note:**\nWhen your opponent's king is exposed, look for checks that win material. Here, Rxa2+ forces Kb3 (only move). Then R2a3+ forces Kxb4, and R8a4+ discovers a powerful fork\u2014both rooks attack the king. After Kc5, you capture the undefended knight with Rxd4, winning significant material. Undefended pieces near the king are often your target.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Rxa2+\", \"line\": [\"Rxa2+\", \"Kb3\", \"R2a3+\", \"Kxb4\", \"R8a4+\", \"Kc5\", \"Rxd4\"], \"motifs\": [\"fork\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "r5k1/8/6P1/5N2/1b1Np3/3bP3/PKp2P2/2R5 b - - 1 42"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "r5k1/8/6P1/5N2/1b1Np3/3bP3/PKp2P2/2R5 b - - 1 42"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "r5k1/8/6P1/5N2/1b1Np3/3bP3/PKp2P2/2R5 b - - 1 42", "square": "b4"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "r5k1/8/6P1/5N2/1b1Np3/3bP3/PKp2P2/2R5 b - - 1 42", "square": "d3"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "r5k1/8/6P1/5N2/1b1Np3/3bP3/PKp2P2/2R5 b - - 1 42", "square": "b2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "r5k1/8/6P1/5N2/1b1Np3/3bP3/PKp2P2/2R5 b - - 1 42"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r5k1/8/6P1/5N2/1b1Np3/3bP3/PKp2P2/2R5 b - - 1 42", "move": "Rxa2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r5k1/8/6P1/5N2/1b1Np3/3bP3/PKp2P2/2R5 b - - 1 42", "move": "Bc3"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r5k1/8/6P1/5N2/1b1Np3/3bP3/PKp2P2/2R5 b - - 1 42", "move": "Ba3"}}, {"tool": "ch